        "### [3] Design tokens\n",
        "\n",
        "All colors (like parchment, ink, jade, gold) are centrally defined here in one single place. The system also mathematically checks whether the contrast between text and background is legible enough for visually impaired people (accessibility according to WCAG standards)."
      ],
