        "### [5] Task 2.2 — CSV Export & Terminal Print\n",
        "\n",
        "- The program saves the land title database on the computer as a real, Excel-readable file called `garuda_land_titles.csv`.\n",
        "- It also generates a neat table directly in the terminal (the console), which stays perfectly aligned even with special Thai characters."
      ],
